{"kind":"doc","route":"/guide/i18n/catalog","title":"The catalogue","blocks":[{"t":"heading","level":1,"id":"the-catalogue","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The catalogue"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"A catalogue is a plain nested object. Nothing is parsed, nothing is loaded from"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"JSON at build time, and every guarantee on this page comes from the type of the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"value itself."}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"import","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  defineCatalog,","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  defineLocale,","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  defineLocaleLike,","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  money,","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  msg,","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  number,","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  plural,","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"} ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"from","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"'@craft-ts/i18n'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":";","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"ts","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"tokens-name-the-parameters","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Tokens name the parameters"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"// A token names a parameter and decides how it is formatted. `amount` is a","kind":"comment"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"// currency, `count` a number — and that is what types the params object.","kind":"comment"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"amount"},{"text":" "},{"text":"=","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"money","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'amount'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":", ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"undefined","kind":"keyword"},{"text":", { currency: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'EUR'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":" });","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"count"},{"text":" "},{"text":"=","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"number","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'count'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":");","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"ts","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"A token carries a "},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"name"}]},{"t":"text","text":" and a "},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"formatter"}]},{"t":"text","text":". The name becomes the parameter"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"key; the formatter decides how the value is rendered in the active locale. That"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"is why "},{"t":"code","text":"msg"},{"t":"text","text":" can derive the params type of a message from the tokens it"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"interpolates — see "},{"t":"link","href":"/craft/guide/i18n/tokens","external":false,"children":[{"t":"text","text":"Tokens"}]},{"t":"text","text":" for the full list."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"definecatalog-msg-plural","children":[{"t":"code","text":"defineCatalog"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"msg"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"plural"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"export","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"enCatalog"},{"text":" "},{"text":"=","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"defineCatalog","kind":"function"},{"text":"({","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  order: {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    total: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"msg","kind":"function"},{"text":"`Order total ${","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"amount","kind":"string"},{"text":"}.`","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    items: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"plural","kind":"function"},{"text":"(count, {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"      one: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"msg","kind":"function"},{"text":"`${","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"count","kind":"string"},{"text":"} item is in the order.`","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"      other: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"msg","kind":"function"},{"text":"`${","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"count","kind":"string"},{"text":"} items are in the order.`","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    }),","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  },","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"});","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[]},{"tokens":[{"text":"export","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"en"},{"text":" "},{"text":"=","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"defineLocale","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'en-US'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":", enCatalog);","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"ts","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"msg"},{"t":"text","text":" is a "},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"tagged template"}]},{"t":"text","text":": the literal parts are text, the interpolations"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"are tokens. "},{"t":"code","text":"msg`Order total ${amount}.`"},{"t":"text","text":" has params "},{"t":"code","text":"{ amount: number }"},{"t":"text","text":","},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"and nothing else."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"plural(count, branches)"},{"t":"text","text":" takes the counting token and one message per category."},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"Which categories are "},{"t":"em","children":[{"t":"text","text":"required"}]},{"t":"text","text":" is decided by the locale id, not by you:"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"defineLocale('pl-PL', …)"},{"t":"text","text":" will not accept a plural missing "},{"t":"code","text":"few"},{"t":"text","text":" or "},{"t":"code","text":"many"},{"t":"text","text":"."},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"That check is a type error, before any Polish speaker sees the wrong branch."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Keys nest as deeply as you like; the key used at the call site is the dotted"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"path."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"every-other-locale-is-definelocalelike","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Every other locale is "},{"t":"code","text":"defineLocaleLike"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"export","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"fr"},{"text":" "},{"text":"=","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"defineLocaleLike","kind":"function"},{"text":"(en, ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'fr-FR'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":", {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  order: {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    total: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"msg","kind":"function"},{"text":"`Total de la commande : ${","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"amount","kind":"string"},{"text":"}.`","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    items: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"plural","kind":"function"},{"text":"(count, {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"      one: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"msg","kind":"function"},{"text":"`${","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"count","kind":"string"},{"text":"} article est dans la commande.`","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"      other: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"msg","kind":"function"},{"text":"`${","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"count","kind":"string"},{"text":"} articles sont dans la commande.`","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    }),","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  },","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"});","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"ts","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"defineLocale"},{"t":"text","text":" is for the "},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"reference"}]},{"t":"text","text":" locale — the one that decides what the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"key set is. Every other locale goes through "},{"t":"code","text":"defineLocaleLike(reference, id, catalog)"},{"t":"text","text":", which checks three things against the reference at compile time:"}]},{"t":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"the same keys, no more and no fewer;"}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"the same parameters on every message;"}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"the plural categories that "},{"t":"em","children":[{"t":"text","text":"this"}]},{"t":"text","text":" locale requires, which may differ from the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"reference's."}]}]]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"assertLocaleParity"},{"t":"text","text":" adds one check the types cannot express: two locales must"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"also agree on "},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"how"}]},{"t":"text","text":" each token is resolved. A locale that swapped a"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"service-resolved money token for a static one, or dropped a parameter's schema,"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"renders through a different path — it is reported as a "},{"t":"code","text":"LOCALE_MISMATCH"},{"t":"text","text":" rather"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"than silently formatting in the wrong currency."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"A renamed key in the reference therefore breaks every translation file that"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"still has the old name, which is the entire point. It also runs"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"assertLocaleParity"},{"t":"text","text":" at construction, so a mismatch that slips past the types —"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"a catalogue built dynamically, say — still fails loudly rather than rendering a"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"key name."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"checking-outside-the-typechecker","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Checking outside the typechecker"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"npm","kind":"function"},{"text":" "},{"text":"run","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"i18n:check","kind":"string"}]}],"filename":"","language":"bash","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Runs catalogue validation and locale parity as an ordinary command, so CI and a"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"pre-commit hook can see what "},{"t":"code","text":"tsc"},{"t":"text","text":" sees. Under the hood it is"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"validateCatalog"},{"t":"text","text":" / "},{"t":"code","text":"assertValidCatalog"},{"t":"text","text":" (also exported from"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"@craft-ts/i18n/testing"},{"t":"text","text":") and "},{"t":"code","text":"validateLocaleParity"},{"t":"text","text":" / "},{"t":"code","text":"assertLocaleParity"},{"t":"text","text":"."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"When it fails, it names the key and the locale. Add the key; do not loosen the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"catalogue's type to make the message go away."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"delivering-a-catalogue-as-data","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Delivering a catalogue as data"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"serializeCatalog(catalog)"},{"t":"text","text":" produces a JSON-safe shape where each token is"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"reduced to its stable "},{"t":"code","text":"tokenId"},{"t":"text","text":" and parameter name — the receiving application"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"registers the executable formatters. A token that parses its input is marked, and"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"a token whose formatter is resolved from the injector is "},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"refused"}]},{"t":"text","text":": its"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"formatter only exists at render time, so a serialised copy would silently format"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"with the default options. Deliver such a message from the application instead."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"next","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Next"}]},{"t":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"link","href":"/craft/guide/i18n/tokens","external":false,"children":[{"t":"text","text":"Tokens"}]},{"t":"text","text":" — what "},{"t":"code","text":"amount"},{"t":"text","text":" and "},{"t":"code","text":"count"},{"t":"text","text":" above actually are."}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"link","href":"/craft/guide/i18n/runtime","external":false,"children":[{"t":"text","text":"The runtime"}]},{"t":"text","text":" — turning these locales into a "},{"t":"code","text":"t"},{"t":"text","text":"."}]}]]}],"outline":[{"level":2,"id":"tokens-name-the-parameters","text":"Tokens name the parameters"},{"level":2,"id":"definecatalog-msg-plural","text":"defineCatalog, msg, plural"},{"level":2,"id":"every-other-locale-is-definelocalelike","text":"Every other locale is defineLocaleLike"},{"level":2,"id":"checking-outside-the-typechecker","text":"Checking outside the typechecker"},{"level":2,"id":"delivering-a-catalogue-as-data","text":"Delivering a catalogue as data"},{"level":2,"id":"next","text":"Next"}]}